      }
    },
    "国标不按底分翻倍算钱，只算番分，起和 8 分。花牌每张 1 分，不计入起和分。拍照识别只认万/筒/条，风牌、箭牌、花牌需手动补入。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCR scores points rather than doubling a base stake; you need 8 points to win. Each flower is worth 1 point but does not count toward the 8. Photo recognition only reads characters/dots/bamboo — winds, dragons and flowers must be added by hand."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "国标不按底分翻倍算钱，只算番分，起和 8 分。花牌每张 1 分，不计入起和分。拍照识别只认万/筒/条，风牌、箭牌、花牌需手动补入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "国标起和 8 分：一副牌的番分（不含花牌）达到 8 分才能和。番型之间遵守不重复计算原则——已经被高番型「包含」的低番型不再另计。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCR needs 8 points to win, flowers excluded. Fan types follow the non-repeat principle: a lower fan already implied by a higher one is not counted again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "国标起和 8 分：一副牌的番分（不含花牌）达到 8 分才能和。番型之间遵守不重复计算原则——已经被高番型「包含」的低番型不再另计。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
