    "桌上的牌（吃 / 碰 / 杠）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the table (chow / pong / kong)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "桌上的牌（吃 / 碰 / 杠）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已吃、已碰、已杠的牌放这里：底部切到「吃 / 碰 / 明杠 / 暗杠」后点牌加入。吃只能吃上家，但本工具不强制这一条——请自行确认这副吃是合法的。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put your chows, pongs and kongs here: switch the keypad to Chow / Pong / Exposed kong / Concealed kong and tap a tile. A chow may only be claimed from the player to your left — this tool does not enforce that, so make sure the chow is legal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已吃、已碰、已杠的牌放这里：底部切到「吃 / 碰 / 明杠 / 暗杠」后点牌加入。吃只能吃上家，但本工具不强制这一条——请自行确认这副吃是合法的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "吃：点起始牌，自动配成连续三张（如点「3万」= 吃 345 万）。分析工具不限制只能吃上家。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chow: tap the lowest tile and the run is completed for you (tap 3 characters = chow 3-4-5 characters). This tool does not restrict who you claimed it from."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "吃：点起始牌，自动配成连续三张（如点「3万」= 吃 345 万）。分析工具不限制只能吃上家。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
