    "选牌后点「分析手牌」：手牌 3n+1 张算听牌/向听，3n+2 张给打牌建议；已吃、已碰、已杠的牌用底部「吃 / 碰 / 明杠 / 暗杠」加到桌上。国标起和 8 分，花牌另计不进起和分。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick tiles, then tap Analyse: 3n+1 tiles gives waits / shanten, 3n+2 gives discard advice. Add chows, pongs and kongs with the keypad's Chow / Pong / Exposed kong / Concealed kong tabs. MCR needs 8 points to win; flowers score separately and do not count toward the 8."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选牌后点「分析手牌」：手牌 3n+1 张算听牌/向听，3n+2 张给打牌建议；已吃、已碰、已杠的牌用底部「吃 / 碰 / 明杠 / 暗杠」加到桌上。国标起和 8 分，花牌另计不进起和分。"
